WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.934
Welcome to Module 4 of Defender
X D R Engineering and Operations:

2
00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:08.712
hunting, detections as
code, and identity signals.

3
00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:12.327
A detection that lives only in
a portal can't be reviewed,

4
00:00:12.327 --> 00:00:16.963
compared or rolled back, and one that
can't be shown to fire isn't a control.

5
00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:20.816
In this module you learn to keep
custom detections as files,

6
00:00:20.816 --> 00:00:25.220
test each one against data it must
find and data it must stay quiet in,

7
00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.737
and deploy it through Microsoft Graph.

8
00:00:27.737 --> 00:00:30.289
Then you join the identity and cloud-app

9
00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:33.150
sensors to the endpoint's
alerts, in one query.

10
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:38.562
The module covers Steps 7 and 8 of the
Defender X D R implementation guide.

11
00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:43.010
It takes about forty-five minutes,
plus Lab 2 in your own test tenant.
